The '''Abbo-Suer District''' was a location on [[Coruscant]]. [[Chemish Runazha]] attended a memorial service for [[Zhuna]] outdoors, under a false sky projection in the Abbo-Suer District<ref name="MoF">''[[Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear]]''</ref> in [[19 BBY]].<ref name="Date">{{MOFdate|21}}</ref>

{{Stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Abbo-Suer District appeared in the [[2025]] novel ''[[Reign of the Empire: The Mask of Fear]]'', written by [[Alexander Freed]] as the first installment of the ''[[Star Wars: Reign of the Empire]]'' trilogy.<ref name="MoF" />

